ef=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ae91dff7-9175-41c5-8946-ce1021c45752\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ae91dff7-9175-41c5-8946-ce1021c45752\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jhaam\" title=\"Jhaam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/25px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/38px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/50px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jhaam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/25px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jhaam\" title=\"Jhaam\">Jhaam</a> an executed drow in the <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-632&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;387</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Jhaam,\n</p><p><br>\nLike a phoenix from the ashes, <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> has risen from the dead. \n</p><p><br>\nI've word of a drow cultist gathering <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">duergar</a> in the old city's halls. That the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a> means to recruit them, I've no doubt. Yet it's what they might seek amidst the ruins that most troubles me.\n</p><p><br>\nYou've not failed me yet. Go to Grymforge, cling to shadow - and bring word of the cult's intentions to <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light</a>. I will be waiting.\n</p><p><br>\nJ\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201438\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1856/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30398/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8005/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936240/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.872      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.872      1 -total\n 56.26%   25.809      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.77%   22.832     19 Template:Trim\n 22.25%   10.207      2 Template:Uid\n 15.75%    7.223      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.69%    6.279      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.27%    5.630      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.13%    4.646      8 Template:Ifempty\n 10.06%    4.614      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12803-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201438 and revision id 275378. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}